<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN BY 59 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN BY 59 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Matabeleland by 59 runs in a one-day cricket match at the Bulawayo Athletic Club on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 210 for nine in 50 overs, Matabeleland 151 all out in 43.3 overs.</p>
